<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Winston Hotels cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Winston Hotels cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs said analyst Richard Moore reduced the rating on Winston Hotels Inc to market perform from market outperformer.</p>
<p>-- analyst not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- shares fell 3/8 to 12-1/2.</p>
</text>
